{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1547","id":4046405100,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87xLz3s","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1547","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1547.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1547.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1547","number":1547,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"ci: route pull request workflows to local runners","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What changed\n\n- Route all 35 jobs across the 23 pull-request-triggered workflows to `[self-hosted, Linux, X64, ciecopilot-heavy]`.\n- Add an explicit temporary guard override that permits self-hosted PR runners while continuing to reject production-like secret references.\n- Preserve the guard's default fail-closed behavior when the override is absent.\n\n## Why\n\nGitHub-hosted jobs are currently failing before execution, while the five local WSL self-hosted runners are online. This provides a temporary bridge until the remote runner workstation is ready.\n\n## Impact and risk\n\nAfter merge, eligible PR code will execute on the maintainer's local WSL machine. This is intentionally temporary and must not be treated as an isolation boundary for untrusted code.\n\nThis PR changes protected CI guard files. The current base guard is expected to block the migration PR itself; activation therefore requires an explicit trusted-maintainer merge decision rather than treating a red guard as a product-code regression.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 -m unittest -v tests.security.test_check_no_self_hosted_pull_request tests.security.test_ci_security_guard_workflow_integrity` (12 passed)\n- `python3 scripts/security/check_no_self_hosted_pull_request.py --allow-self-hosted-pr .github/workflows` (passed)\n- Default guard without the override still fails closed against the temporary self-hosted PR routes (expected)\n- PyYAML parsed all 29 workflow files\n- Audit confirmed 23 PR workflows, 35 jobs, and 35 matching local-runner routes with no remaining `ubuntu-latest` jobs in PR workflows\n- `git diff --check` (passed)\n","created_at":"2026-07-13T17:21:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T10:23:17Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T10:23:09Z","merged_at":"2026-07-14T10:23:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"f8e7f9d1e75ab2e87c82f053367d439ce8aa5aa2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1547/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1547/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1547/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/1bfc545dad89b013ca4a0603bef186b990baffba","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/20260714-all-pr-local-runners","ref"